      "rationale": "L1 explicitly names position 214 in the P2-M4 extracellular loop of KCNK5 as the HA-tag insertion site. Python verification confirms residue 214 is N (Asn) and residue 215 is P (Pro), both within the authoritative extracellular span 185\u2013225. The insertion is 30 residues from the upstream TM3 boundary (ends at 184) and 12 residues from the downstream TM4 boundary (starts at 226), satisfying the \u22653-residue clearance on both sides. No cysteine residues are present in this extracellular span, removing disulfide-bond concern at this site. HA epitope (YPYDVPDYA) flanked by PGG linkers on each side was inserted at amino acid position 214 in the extracellular P2-M4 loop of human TASK-2 (KCNK5, construct called TASK-\u0394i20); cRNA injected into Xenopus oocytes and surface expression assayed by chemiluminescence after 48 h.",
